<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <%- include('partials/head', { title: 'Before you download - Terp Notes' }) %>
</head>
<body class="tn-app">
    <%- include('partials/publicnav', { hideAuth: true }) %>

    <main class="tn-center" id="main">
        <div class="tn-card tn-card-wide tn-status">
            <div class="tn-status-icon is-warn" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M10.3 3.9 1.8 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.7 3h17a2 2 0 0 0 1.7-3L13.7 3.9a2 2 0 0 0-3.4 0Z"/><path d="M12 9v4M12 17h.01"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h1>This is a zip file</h1>
            <p class="tn-sub"><strong><%= originalName %></strong> passed our virus scan, but archives can hide files a scan misses.</p>
            <div class="tn-alert tn-alert-warn">
                <div>
                    <strong>Before you open it</strong>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Unzip it and look inside before opening anything.</li>
                        <li>Don't run programs (.exe, .bat, .sh, .app) from it.</li>
                        <li>If something looks off, report the file from the dashboard.</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="tn-actions">
                <a href="/download/<%= encodeURIComponent(filename) %>?warn=skip" class="tn-btn tn-btn-primary tn-btn-lg">Download anyway</a>
                <a href="/dashboard" class="tn-btn tn-btn-outline tn-btn-lg">Back to notes</a>
            </div>
            <p class="tn-alt" style="font-size: 0.82rem;">Files are uploaded by students. Terp Notes doesn't review every file's contents.</p>
        </div>
    </main>

    <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
